  lines:
  - speakerName: Maripili
    lineText: "Per\xF2 que dius tu ara xiquet? Com es va a menjar a alg\xFA del poble?
      Estem bojos?"
    expression: {fileID: 2575970253454553181, guid: 4b415fae88a3f16e985155be15f2c9d3, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 0
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Maripili
    lineText: "Per\xF2 no es mala idea. A lo millor es calma una mica si t\xE9 la
      panxa plena."
    expression: {fileID: 2575970253454553181, guid: 4b415fae88a3f16e985155be15f2c9d3, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 0
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Joaquin
    lineText: "Crec que a un \xF3s li podria agradar la mel."
    expression: {fileID: 9125249484933913112, guid: 14c58c64c003fa97ca1c2795a3c4160a, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 1
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Maripili
    lineText: "I aix\xF2 per qu\xE8?"
    expression: {fileID: 2575970253454553181, guid: 4b415fae88a3f16e985155be15f2c9d3, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 0
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Joaquin
    lineText: Tot el mon sap que als ossos els agrada la mel.
    expression: {fileID: 1236392363465906612, guid: 3262f44a6fd4064a7b582db6be41871c, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 1
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Maripili
    lineText: "Si tu o dius. Crec que en venen a la panaderia aix\xED que ves i compra\u2019n."
    expression: {fileID: 8747955740245679328, guid: 1c5e3b832e319170f90a9ea07e2aa8a4, type: 3}
    isPlayerSpeaking: 0
    isChoice: 0
    choiceA: {fileID: 0}
    choiceB: {fileID: 0}
    choiceC: {fileID: 0}
    choiceD: {fileID: 0}
    hasReward: 0
    reward: 
    startsMinigame: 0
    minigame: 
  - speakerName: Joaquin
    lineText: "D\u2019acord! Ara torne."
    expression: {fileID: 8517940295573926053, guid: c3b1402a4e92366fb8ab7e4d9cf6129b, type: 3}
